ype":"radio","prompt":"<div>What makes Jonathan happiest is ...</div>","choices":[{"id":3452,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>philosophy</span>"},{"id":3453,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>writing</span>"},{"id":3454,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>tragedy </span>"}]},{"id":2332,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Jonathan thinks he has ... </div>","choices":[{"id":3455,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>few negative traits</span>"},{"id":3456,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>some negative traits</span>"},{"id":3457,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>many negative traits</span>"}]},{"id":2333,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>When Jonathan once asked a poet to sign his hand, the poet ...</div>","choices":[{"id":3458,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>didn’t like it</span>"},{"id":3459,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>laughed</span>"},{"id":3460,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>thought it was a joke</span>"}]},{"id":2334,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What Jonathan most dislikes about his appearance is ...</div>","choices":[{"id":3461,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>his face</span>"},{"id":3462,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>the fact that he is fat </span>"},{"id":3463,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>his glasses</span>"}]},{"id":2335,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>His first kiss was ...</div>","choices":[{"id":3464,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>not very nice</span>"},{"id":3465,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>long</span>"},{"id":3466,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>when he was 19 years old</span>"}]},{"id":2336,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>When was the last time Jonathan cried?</div>","choices":[{"id":3467,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>Not long ago, at a funeral.</span>"},{"id":3468,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>A long time ago at a wedding. </span>"},{"id":3469,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>A few days ago at a wedding. </span>"}]}]}]}